{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"db81a508ea2a000ca803bf2dc4b1e082bb56ce76dbb44e80e8edfd9ff24223e2","ja":"パーティーの準備","zh":"派对的准备","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0dc9a88ec70c5d58f8b9a4288b709b3fd4729a9553cbdc1b35b9d5ca605e6dde","ja":"ねえねえ、コトハ。このアイスなんてどうかナ？\nマーブルになってて、いろんな味が楽しめそうだヨ！","zh":"我说我说，琴叶。这个冰淇淋怎么样呢？\n是大理石花纹的，感觉能享受到各种口味哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"a6529fe9627a47c5c45977fe282040dc9a370f72b6c60aed920224d3ef08736a","ja":"私もそれ気になってたの♪　じゃあ、それは決まりで。\nあとは、バニラとか王道なのも欲しいな……。","zh":"我也挺在意那个的♪ 那么，那个就定下来啦。\n剩下的，还想要香草之类的经典口味啊……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3d94ad0b8f5797ed85fdd7e4c4cb2c3c370d94696abac93ad5a6d975b7630b7f","ja":"それなら、こっちの……。","zh":"那这样的话，这边的……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"1e1817bf38a201832153231f26f908883673acfe2f45ccf7b5daa366aa1a33e0","ja":"ふたりとも、おはよう！\n何の話をしてるの？","zh":"你们两位，早上好！\n在聊什么呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"b85b0eb3c542ff20273f173dba606c62633ce4eb317ce2716204383eb7a62c8d","ja":"今度、アイスクリームパーティーをしようって\nなったノ。それで、アイスを選んでたんだヨ！","zh":"我们约好下次要办冰淇淋派对呢。\n所以，我就在挑冰淇淋啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"b902d3c4aedee6c150ed17e7d67ee0a6b5e91941d7373cf52d592d13855c791b","ja":"えっ、アイスクリームパーティー！？","zh":"欸，冰淇淋派对！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"67ceec09a5b340d40d406bb94e4b777dfe97d02afb1f326457813b507aab7ecf","ja":"私の好きなお店が、\nいろんなフレーバーのアイスを売っていて……。","zh":"我喜欢的那家店，\n有卖各种不同口味的冰淇淋……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"286f0da716586e722be7ff61d70c911605461d4de5f3153b9e210fdc76926179","ja":"気になるのがいっぱいあるんだけど、\nひとりで食べるのはさすがにって、迷ってて……。","zh":"想吃的东西有很多，\n但一个人吃实在有点吃不下，正犹豫着呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"afbdd949c35b633671d3dd14ac311996c700a21027ccf5bf39e72dea94b4194a","ja":"そしたらエレナが、みんなでパーティーをしたら、\nいろんな種類を食べれるって、提案してくれたんだ。","zh":"然后艾莲娜就提议说，要是大家一起办个派对，\n就能吃到各种各样的种类了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"9611b8a638a820443c034cefa5601355d85cbddd87d91317001f2120880914ed","ja":"スケジュールの都合もあるから、今回は一緒に公演を\nしたメンバーを誘うつもりだヨ。もちろん、ミナコも！","zh":"因为日程安排的关系，这次打算邀请一起参加\n公演的成员唷。当然，美奈子也在内！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"6a1d94338a9d10d1bbff57725b505f3453f6ff0ef476a42c28b651d6b5b1fadb","ja":"わっほーい！","zh":"哇吼——！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"b7556c8856a15c774e0ae4348624e57bb4d0e8788101faea15957e160ae44521","ja":"じゃあ、いろんな種類のアイスを食べられるように、\nしっかり選ばないとだね♪","zh":"那么，为了能吃到各种各样的冰淇淋，\n可得好好挑选才行呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"86ec541c6c6a3b34548470b6540078ec6b3c7108ecb16130b713a4b8a4f498f6","ja":"あとは場所と時間の確保と、アイス以外に必要なものを\n考えて……よし、今日中に計画を立てちゃおう！","zh":"剩下的就是确定场地和时间，以及考虑除了冰淇淋之外\n还需要什么……好，今天之内就把计划定下来吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1451.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"43482a0bbbd9f9f467ae0dfb497e4f25faec5e8adffc79b5c79dc5bf48c4dc01","ja":"トッピングとか、シロップなんかも欲しいよネ！\nエヘヘ、今から楽しみだヨ～♪","zh":"还想要配料和糖浆什么的呢！\n嘿嘿，现在就开始期待了唷～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
